{"id":"vd-a2-the-exchange-student","level":"a2","n":22,"title":{"en":"Your School Is Bigger Than Mine!","vi":"Trường cậu to hơn trường tớ!"},"summary":"Sau tuần đầu ở Ohio, Harper hỏi Lucas thấy nước Mỹ khác nước Pháp thế nào — từ giờ ăn tối đến trường học và bánh mì.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-exchange-student","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The Exchange Student","vi":"Du học sinh trao đổi"}},"scene":{"background":"campus-gate","props":[]},"cast":{"harper":{"name":{"en":"Harper","vi":"Harper"},"look":"teengirl","x":500,"style":{"hair":"ponytail","hairColor":"#B5652E","outfit":"jacket","top":"#E5484D","topShade":"#C73A3F"}},"lucas":{"name":{"en":"Lucas","vi":"Lucas"},"look":"teenboy","x":1130,"style":{"hair":"curly","hairColor":"#3A2A22","outfit":"shirt","top":"#3F7FCB","topShade":"#2F66AA","scarf":"#F2C14E"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"harper","en":"So, Lucas, how was your first week?","vi":"Nào, Lucas, tuần đầu tiên của cậu thế nào?","ipa":["soʊ","ˈlukəs","haʊ","wɑz","jɔɹ","fɝst","wik"],"start":0.554,"end":2.634,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.804],[2,1.361],[3,1.511],[4,1.701],[5,1.851],[6,2.245]]},{"speaker":"lucas","en":"Great! But everything is different here.","vi":"Tuyệt lắm! Nhưng ở đây cái gì cũng khác.","ipa":["ɡɹeɪt","bʌt","ˈɛvɹiˌθɪŋ","ɪz","ˈdɪfɚənt","hiɹ"],"start":3.424,"end":5.374,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,3.424],[1,4.137],[2,4.248],[3,4.64],[4,4.762],[5,5.069]]},{"speaker":"harper","en":"Different how?","vi":"Khác thế nào?","ipa":["ˈdɪfɚənt","haʊ"],"start":6.164,"end":7.024,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,6.164],[1,6.53]]},{"speaker":"lucas","en":"Well, your school is much bigger than mine.","vi":"Thì, trường cậu to hơn trường tớ nhiều.","ipa":["wɛl","jɔɹ","skul","ɪz","mʌtʃ","ˈbɪɡɚ","ðæn","maɪn"],"start":7.814,"end":9.894,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,7.814],[1,8.358],[2,8.468],[3,8.811],[4,8.922],[5,9.191],[6,9.473],[7,9.62]]},{"speaker":"lucas","en":"You even have a stadium!","vi":"Các cậu có cả sân vận động!","ipa":["ju","ˈivɪn","hæv","ə","ˈsteɪdiəm"],"start":10.434,"end":11.474,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,10.434],[1,10.522],[2,10.731],[3,10.865],[4,10.915]]},{"speaker":"harper","en":"Yeah, football is the most important sport here.","vi":"Ừ, ở đây bóng bầu dục là môn thể thao quan trọng nhất.","ipa":["jæ","ˈfʊtˌbɔl","ɪz","ðə","moʊst","ˌɪmˈpɔɹtənt","spɔɹt","hiɹ"],"start":12.264,"end":14.894,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,12.264],[1,12.474],[2,13.017],[3,13.153],[4,13.262],[5,13.601],[6,14.091],[7,14.471]]},{"speaker":"lucas","en":"And dinner is much earlier. In France, we eat at eight.","vi":"Bữa tối cũng sớm hơn nhiều. Ở Pháp, bọn tớ ăn lúc tám giờ.","ipa":["ənd","ˈdɪnɚ","ɪz","mʌtʃ","ˈɝliɚ","ɪn","fɹæns","wi","it","æt","eɪt"],"start":15.684,"end":18.754,"gesture":"explain","thoughtBubble":"clock:8:00","timing":[[0,15.684],[1,15.748],[2,16.054],[3,16.164],[4,16.446],[5,17.28],[6,17.365],[7,18.003],[8,18.211],[9,18.346],[10,18.481]]},{"speaker":"harper","en":"Eight? I'd be so hungry!","vi":"Tám giờ á? Tớ đói chết mất!","ipa":["eɪt","aɪd","bi","soʊ","ˈhʌŋɡɹi"],"start":19.544,"end":21.464,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,19.544],[1,20.202],[2,20.392],[3,20.555],[4,20.827]]},{"speaker":"lucas","en":"The portions are bigger here, too. The biggest pizza I've ever seen!","vi":"Khẩu phần ở đây cũng to hơn. Cái pizza to nhất tớ từng thấy!","ipa":["ðə","ˈpɔɹʃənz","ɑɹ","ˈbɪɡɚ","hiɹ","tu","ðə","ˈbɪɡəst","ˈpitsə","aɪv","ˈɛvɚ","sin"],"start":22.254,"end":25.854,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,22.254],[1,22.296],[2,22.712],[3,22.81],[4,23.092],[5,23.546],[6,24.244],[7,24.342],[8,24.685],[9,25.114],[10,25.261],[11,25.433]]},{"speaker":"harper","en":"Is French food better than American food?","vi":"Đồ ăn Pháp có ngon hơn đồ ăn Mỹ không?","ipa":["ɪz","fɹɛntʃ","fud","ˈbɛtɚ","ðæn","əˈmɛɹəkən","fud"],"start":26.644,"end":28.894,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,26.644],[1,26.772],[2,27.125],[3,27.451],[4,27.737],[5,27.913],[6,28.443]]},{"speaker":"lucas","en":"Hmm… it's not as big, but it's… more interesting.","vi":"Ừm… nó không to bằng, nhưng… thú vị hơn.","ipa":["hm","ɪts","nɑt","æz","bɪɡ","bʌt","ɪts","mɔɹ","ˈɪntɹəstɪŋ"],"start":29.684,"end":32.854,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,29.684],[1,30.4],[2,30.522],[3,30.718],[4,30.853],[5,31.527],[6,31.65],[7,32.054],[8,32.287]]},{"speaker":"harper","en":"That's very polite! What about people?","vi":"Nói thế lịch sự quá! Còn con người thì sao?","ipa":["ðæts","ˈvɛɹi","pəˈlaɪt","wʌt","əˈbaʊt","ˈpipəl"],"start":33.644,"end":36.444,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,33.644],[1,33.881],[2,34.221],[3,35.335],[4,35.498],[5,35.865]]},{"speaker":"lucas","en":"People here are friendlier with strangers. They talk to me in shops!","vi":"Người ở đây thân thiện với người lạ hơn. Họ bắt chuyện với tớ trong cửa hàng!","ipa":["ˈpipəl","hiɹ","ɑɹ","ˈfɹɛndliɚ","wɪð","ˈstɹeɪndʒɚz","ðeɪ","tɔk","tu","mi","ɪn","ʃɑps"],"start":37.234,"end":40.534,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,37.234],[1,37.459],[2,37.668],[3,37.754],[4,38.207],[5,38.354],[6,39.408],[7,39.469],[8,39.69],[9,39.763],[10,39.898],[11,39.984]]},{"speaker":"harper","en":"And in France?","vi":"Còn ở Pháp?","ipa":["ənd","ɪn","fɹæns"],"start":41.324,"end":42.264,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,41.324],[1,41.394],[2,41.571]]},{"speaker":"lucas","en":"In France, we're quieter. But we kiss more!","vi":"Ở Pháp, bọn tớ trầm hơn. Nhưng hôn má nhiều hơn!","ipa":["ɪn","fɹæns","wiɹ","ˈkwaɪətɚ","bʌt","wi","kɪs","mɔɹ"],"start":43.054,"end":45.634,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,43.054],[1,43.118],[2,43.841],[3,43.976],[4,44.883],[5,44.968],[6,45.079],[7,45.311]]},{"speaker":"harper","en":"I know! My face was redder than a tomato at the airport!","vi":"Tớ biết! Ở sân bay mặt tớ còn đỏ hơn cả quả cà chua!","ipa":["aɪ","noʊ","maɪ","feɪs","wɑz","ˈɹɛdɚ","ðæn","ə","təˈmeɪˌtoʊ","æt","ðə","ˈɛɹˌpɔɹt"],"start":46.424,"end":50.294,"expression":"shy","react":{"lucas":"happy"},"timing":[[0,46.424],[1,46.511],[2,47.367],[3,47.571],[4,47.952],[5,48.169],[6,48.495],[